  "description": "The FRS SIGNATURE is built for freeride, it's our definition of the ultimate machine.\n• A FOX 40 fork equipped with Grip X2 cartridge offers precise adjustment and fine-tune opportunities for your setup to dominate every track. The FOX Float X2 Factory shock with its 4-way adjustment and new design provides flawless support and formidable dynamism from the word go.\n• TRP DHR EVO PRO brakes are renowned for their constant power and control, even on the most technical descents.\n• The wheel set-up features a DT SWISS FR541 rim at the front and an FR571 at the rear, hand-mounted on 350 hubs for a robust combo ready to handle the most demanding terrain.\n• A SRAM GX DH 7-speed drivetrain is precise and perfect for downhill.",
